      "description": "Outlined ink button for secondary actions (Refine, Example trip).",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-secondary\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 7h10M18 7h2M4 17h4M12 17h8\"/><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"7\" r=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"17\" r=\"2\"/></svg>Refine</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-secondary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:44px;padding:0 16px;background:transparent;border:1px solid #AEB5BE;border-radius:10px;color:#111418;font:600 13px/18px Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .16s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}.ds-btn-secondary:hover{background:#ECEEF1}.ds-btn-secondary:active{transform:scale(.97);opacity:.9}.ds-btn-secondary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #FF5A1F;outline-offset:2px}"
