      "description": "Pill facts: neutral weather, warning hazard, accent only for Best match.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-chips\"><span class=\"ds-chip\">11°C</span><span class=\"ds-chip ds-chip-warn\">31° · Monsoon</span><span class=\"ds-chip ds-chip-accent\">Best match</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-chips{display:flex;gap:8px;background:#fff;padding:12px}.ds-chip{padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECEEF1;color:#59616C;font:500 12px/16px Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-chip-warn{background:#FFF1D6;color:#8A5A00}.ds-chip-accent{background:#FF5A1F;color:#111418}"
    },
    {
